  "extra": {
    "info": "FULL CONTROL workflow — X, Y, Size, Rotation.\n\nCONTROLS:\n• Node 7 (SIZE): scale_by factor — 0.30 = 30% of original. Change to resize furniture proportionally.\n• Node 8: MUST match node 7's factor exactly (keeps mask aligned).\n• Node 9 (ROTATE image): angle in degrees. Positive = counter-clockwise.\n• Node 10 (ROTATE mask): MUST match node 9's angle exactly.\n• Node 11 (POSITION): X, Y pixel coordinates — top-left corner of furniture on the room.\n\nWORKFLOW:\nload room + load furniture → remove white bg → scale image & mask (same factor) → rotate image & mask (same angle) → composite onto room at X,Y → save.\n\nNOTE: Requires ImageTransform node (WAS Node Suite or ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts). If unavailable, swap nodes 13 & 14 for any rotation node from your installed packs — just keep the angle identical on both."
